# ==============================================================================
# Event Participant Project Mapping (Template)
# Format: PROJECT_ID, IAP_MEMBER, REGION, ROLE
#
# Copy this file to `projects.txt` before running `./deploy.sh`:
#   cp projects.txt.example projects.txt
#
# ⚠️ ATTENTION: This event includes labs that need a dedicated Admin Project
# (for the shared BigQuery Enterprise Graph slot reservation).
# Exactly ONE project MUST be designated 'role=admin'. It hosts event-wide
# infrastructure contributed by the selected labs and is provisioned before,
# and destroyed after, every participant project.
#
# 🚨 CRITICAL SECURITY & OPERATIONAL NOTICE:
# - NEVER distribute the Admin Project (role=admin) credentials to participants!
# - Minimum 2 projects: exactly 1 role=admin and at least 1 role=participant.
# - Trailing fields are order-independent key=value tokens (role=..., city=...).
#
# Examples:
#   my-admin-project, admin@example.com, us-central1, role=admin
#   my-participant-project-01, user:participant01@example.com, us-central1, role=participant
#   my-participant-project-02, user:participant02@example.com, us-central1, role=participant
# ==============================================================================
